# A template's lockfile is build output, not part of the template. It pins
# clwd-sdk through the relative path the repository uses, and `clwd init`
# rewrites that path — so a shipped lockfile would describe a resolution the
# scaffolded project does not have. Each project generates its own on first
# build.
templates/*/Cargo.lock
